              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi lo arai lokookeng a Yese, apolokini Isirael daang ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a ngikaru a ngitomwon-omwon. Arai ngesi ekapolon alo Eburon a ngikaru a ngikan-kaarei. Toliwor ekapolon alo Yerusalem a ngikaru a ngitomwon-uni ka nguuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totoan ngesi akaalimon kemojong, tarai ekabaran lo arimae. Kilunyokin lokookeng Solomon nados keng toliwor ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakiro a ekapolon Daudi napei anakisiakinet tanang losal, igiritae nakitabea a ngikadwarak aluuni anyaritae Samuel, ka Nasan ta Gad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
